source_reference = "Hyzer Flip author-authored gameplay calibration for the stable prototype distance driver. Moment coefficients are calibrated for angular-momentum precession and aerodynamic spin damping. The raised low-to-mid-angle drag curve limits excess glide, while consistently negative high- and low-speed moment curves produce a stable fade response across the 0 to -10 degree release envelope. This is not measured aerodynamic data; replace it with independently collected or separately licensed validation data before release."
